      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I just saw it on an avatar of a friend of mine. During testing we found out, that even with all layers removed (meaning locomotion, Action, FX) it still bugs out. It does seem, that after approx 1 second after load the IK does get stuck in the \"last known locomotion layer animation\". Meaning if you are on live and you crouch, people in beta will see you crouching continuusly. If you during that second walk backwards, you are getting stuck in a \"walking backwards\" animation. \nEdit:\nwe just send our friend into the beta channel as well. Me (live, remote) sees the avatar walking normaly, her (beta, local) sees the avatar walking normal, another friend (beta, remote) sees her in the stuck state.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
