  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In the current beta, i've come across an issue. Other friends/players running this current build are unable to see my tracking/ik on my main avatars and it \"Works for a split second, then it looks like i'm playing in desktop\". friends not using this beta are able to see my traking and ik perfectly with no issues or hiccups. I must clarify that this only happens on my main avatars and no other avatars are affected by this. There is also a correlation to this, any avatar that does not show IK to others in the current beta will not spin normally on the avatar preview, but will spin around the world (has been an issue but ignored it) like in this link to this video i recorded \nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1dhT_dl2OkJPRY1DZqqsyTi1fgjDmdIyd/view?usp=sharing\n(at the end you can see the avatar flying around the map for a split second)\nI must again make it clear that IK on my end for these avatars is crystal clear, and only will not work for other friends and people in the current beta build and not those running non-beta\npictures below show my freinds screen and my screen while i'm crouching",
